5,1,1,talk,George,,I worry we are just moving the sore point. Let’s look at what actually sours groups like ours before we decide anything.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Agreed. The friction is in the coordination, not the driving. I want to see where those hours actually go before we commit.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I need to know the car’s condition at handover. If it’s unreliable, no schedule fixes the daily frustration.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’m concerned about the hidden costs. We need to see the tax and insurance papers to understand the true baseline before splitting anything.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know the real numbers. Who drives how much? I don’t want to guess anymore.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, your point about coordination is valid. But I suspect the real issue is how we handle the small, repeated frictions.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, exactly. The small frictions compound. I want to track the actual time spent on logistics, not just the fuel.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, tracking logistics is useful, but I need to verify the physical state. If the car is unreliable, your data is meaningless.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, reliability matters, but I need the financial baseline first. Let’s check the tax and insurance papers to see the true fixed costs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I agree. The papers will show the real costs. I want to see the fuel receipts too, to know who drove.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,"@Minato, numbers are vital, but they don’t explain the silence. I want to understand the social dynamics that broke down, not just the mileage.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, silence is a symptom, not the cause. I need to quantify the administrative burden. I will check the diary hours and the mechanic’s remarks.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the mechanic’s remarks are crucial. I need to know if the car is failing. I will check the handover state and the service notes.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, the diary helps, but I need the fixed costs. I will check the tax and insurance papers, plus the fuel receipts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look into the fuel receipts and the diary hours. I want to see the real driving patterns.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,I will check the spell of checking figures and what other households said. We need to see if our own habits caused the breakdown.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will check the diary hours and the mechanic’s remarks. I need to quantify the administrative burden and verify the car’s actual condition.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will check the state of the car at handover and the mechanic’s remarks. I need to know if it’s safe to drive.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I will check the tax and insurance papers, plus the fuel receipts. I need the fixed costs and actual usage to calculate a fair split.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
